  "description": "Jisoo, who dreamed of becoming a fairy tale illustrator since she was young, dropped out to achieve her dream and went to her grandmother's house, where she meets Dowon.\n\nDowon, who was worried about not having a dream, is interested in Jisoo who is trying hard to achieve her dream.\n\n\"The farther you try to catch, the farther away you feel. When will the day you reach your dream come?\"",
